8/01/01/books/review-fire-sermon-jamie-quatro.html', 'snippet': 'Quatro’s first novel, following an acclaimed collection of stories, is about a religious woman in a passionless marriage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jamie Quatro’s fiction makes you want to hit the gym. Her women seek transcendence in exertion. They go for runs, scan the woods for bike trails, consult personal trainers. In her first book, a mesmerizing collection of stories titled “I Want to Show You More” (2013), running was so intensely evoked that Runner’s World magazine dispatched a profile writer to the author’s home.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/02/books/02bookquatro2/02bookquatro2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 897, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/02/books/02bookquatro2/02bookquatro2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 897}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/02/books/02bookquatro2/02bookquatro2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 685, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/02/books/02bookquatro2/02bookquatro2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1370, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/02/books/02bookquatro2/02bookquatro2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/02/books/02bookquatro2/02bookquatro2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': Non