rticle/14d32773-2c19-5fd5-98d4-7679b445b847'}, {'abstract': 'The former Fox News anchor, whose suit against Roger Ailes led to his departure from Fox, will be expected to lead the pageant through its own harassment scandal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/01/business/gretchen-carlson-miss-america.html', 'snippet': 'The former Fox News anchor, whose suit against Roger Ailes led to his departure from Fox, will be expected to lead the pageant through its own harassment scandal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gretchen Carlson, who was Miss America in 1989 and in recent years has become a prominent voice against workplace sexual harassment, will take over as chairwoman of the pageant’s board of directors, the organization announced on Monday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/02/us/02xp-missamerica1/02xp-missamerica1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/02/us/02xp-missamerica1/02xp-missamerica1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/02/us/02xp-missamerica1/02xp-missamerica1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/02/us/02xp-missamerica1/02xp-missamerica1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/02/us/02xp-missamerica1/02xp-missamerica1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legac