ng it out might do as much harm as good.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/02/magazine/american-politics-is-swamped-with-bad-faith-actors.html', 'snippet': 'Duplicitousness, mendacity, advantage-taking — once someone commits to tactics like these, pointing it out might do as much harm as good.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The biggest political contests of 2017 were defined by their asymmetries: in funding, in ideology and, most viscerally, in strategy. On one side were those who saw everything as a battle and sought whatever advantage they could find. On the other were those devoted to what they thought were shared systems, norms and language, who spent most of the year increasingly beleaguered and struggling to find words.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/magazine/07mag-firstwords/07mag-07firstwords-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 591, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/07/magazine/07mag-firstwords/07mag-07firstwords-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 591}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/magazine/07mag-firstwords/07mag-07firstwords-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1008, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/magazine/07mag-firstwords/07mag-07firstwords-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1915, 'width': 1945, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/magazine/07mag-firstwords/07mag-07firstwords-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 