word_count': 823, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef08b199-1b9f-531e-ab27-f7da10618f87'}, {'abstract': 'Before I went to college, I thought of change as something I could control.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/03/opinion/reinvention-college-freshman-change.html', 'snippet': 'Before I went to college, I thought of change as something I could control.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Singapore — In high school, my friends and I spent many afternoons discussing how our lives would change once we went to college. Lounging around coffee shops or our parents’ apartments, we’d fantasize aloud about prospective friends, future boyfriends and the careers we hoped to have after graduation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/02/opinion/02oncampus/02oncampus-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/02/opinion/02oncampus/02oncampus-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/02/opinion/02oncampus/02oncampus-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/02/opinion/02oncampus/02oncampus-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/02/opinion/02oncampus/02oncampus-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/02/opinion/02oncampus/02oncampus-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype'