ars, budget cuts at the National Health Service have left hospitals stretched over the winter. This time, it is under the highest strain in decades.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/03/world/europe/uk-national-health-service.html', 'snippet': 'For years, budget cuts at the National Health Service have left hospitals stretched over the winter. This time, it is under the highest strain in decades.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — At some emergency wards, patients wait more than 12 hours before they are tended to. Corridors are jammed with beds carrying frail and elderly patients waiting to be admitted to hospital wards. Outpatient appointments were canceled to free up staff members, and by Wednesday morning hospitals had been ordered to postpone nonurgent surgeries until the end of the month.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/04/world/europe/04nhs1/merlin_129543122_8ff3f3f2-5e90-4a8b-be00-50a55bfab720-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/04/world/europe/04nhs1/merlin_129543122_8ff3f3f2-5e90-4a8b-be00-50a55bfab720-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/04/world/europe/04nhs1/merlin_129543122_8ff3f3f2-5e90-4a8b-be00-50a55bfab720-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/04/world/europe/04nhs1/merlin_129543122_8ff3f3f2-5e90-4a8b-be00-50a55bfab720-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'cred