one. Her sister looked anxiously at the clerk at the triage desk at the University of Iowa hospital emergency room. The woman’s breath was rapid and coarse. Her chest heaved with the work of simply breathing. She pulled at the neck of her sweatshirt — suddenly it was too tight. She pulled it over her head and dropped it to the floor. She was naked beneath the top; she had been in bed when this attack came on.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/magazine/07mag-diagnosis1/07mag-diagnosis1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 508, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/07/magazine/07mag-diagnosis1/07mag-diagnosis1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 508}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/magazine/07mag-diagnosis1/07mag-diagnosis1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 867, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/magazine/07mag-diagnosis1/07mag-diagnosis1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1486, 'width': 1755, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/magazine/07mag-diagnosis1/07mag-diagnosis1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/07/magazine/07mag-diagnosis1/07mag-diagnosis1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/magazine/07mag-diagnosis1/07mag-diagnosis1-thumbLarge.jpg