me?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Season of Change', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golden Globes (Awards)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weinstein, Harvey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-01-05T17:00:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jodi Kantor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jodi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kantor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f91bd639-8f10-5df1-9caf-0de69e3c4712', 'word_count': 250, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f91bd639-8f10-5df1-9caf-0de69e3c4712'}, {'abstract': 'Some red carpet photos have become a metaphor for the difficulty of confronting or rejecting powerful men who harass or assault.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/05/style/weinstein-red-carpet-photos-smiles.html', 'snippet': 'Some red carpet photos have become a metaphor for the difficulty of confronting or rejecting powerful men who harass or assault.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Red carpet photos conceal as much as they reveal. These are professional actors, after all. Old photos, from awards seasons and film premieres long past, show victims of Harvey Weinstein’s alleged harassment captured in front of cameras with the man they now call their abuser. In recent months, many of these actresses have said they felt they had no choice but to smile and pose. The photos have become a metaphor for the difficulty of confronting or rejecting powerful men who harass or assault.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/fashion/07GLOBES-CURTAIN-COMBO/07GLOBES-CURTAIN-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/07/fashion/07GLOBES-CURTAIN-COMBO/07GLOBES-CURTAIN-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/fashion/07GLOBES-CURTAIN-COMBO/07GLOBES-CURTAIN-COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/fashion/07GLOBES-CURTAIN-COMBO/07GLOBES-CURTAIN-COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/fashion/07GLOBES-CURTAIN-COMBO/07GLOBES-CURTAIN-COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/07/fashion/07GLOBES-CURTAIN-COMBO/07GLOBES-CURTAIN-COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/fashion/07GLOBES-CURTAIN-COMBO/07GLOBES-CURTAIN-COMBO-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What the Smiles Concealed', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What These Smiles May Have Concealed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golden Globes (