ur Child Lying to You? That’s Good', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Psychology and Psychologists', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lying', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-01-05T20:00:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alex Stone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alex', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/326b802d-a580-59c1-a341-92782aa2434c', 'word_count': 1198, 'uri': 'nyt://article/326b802d-a580-59c1-a341-92782aa2434c'}, {'abstract': 'The tragedy of the crash is particularly difficult to reconcile with the remarkable beauty of Costa Rica — a place I wouldn’t hesitate to return to.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/05/travel/costa-rica-crash-ecotravel.html', 'snippet': 'The tragedy of the crash is particularly difficult to reconcile with the remarkable beauty of Costa Rica — a place I wouldn’t hesitate to return to.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I remember my first night in Costa Rica, and the color of the sunset. I had an entire beach nearly to myself, and swatted the occasional sandfly as I watched bruised grays and yellows stretching across the horizon, pinks popping vividly, in part thanks to the lack of any visible electric light from the shore. I would spend those next few days in late March snorkeling in limpid, blue waters, hiking in Corcovado National Park, and riding around on the back of a motorbike in one of the more splendid, unspoiled places I’d ever visited.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/04/travel/04FRUGAL/04FRUGAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/06/04/travel/04FRUGAL/04FRUGAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/04/travel/04FRUGAL/04FRUGAL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/04/travel/04FRUGAL/04FRUGAL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/04/travel/04FRUGAL/04FRUGAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/06/04/travel/04FRUGAL/04FRUGAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/06/04/travel/04FRUGAL/04FRUGAL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After a Tragedy, Making the Case for Costa Rica', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Costa Rica', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Eco-Tourism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aviation Accidents, Safety and Disasters', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-01-05T20:02:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {