icle/10627118-d8f0-5d9b-aafb-a12407af9f55'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Saturday, January 6, 2018.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/05/todayspaper/quotation-of-the-day-new-jersey-is-last-state-to-insist-at-gas-station-dont-touch-that-pump.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Saturday, January 6, 2018.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The only thing you could argue is that New Jerseyans are more flammable than people in the other 49 states. Because we eat so much oily pizza, funnel cake and fries, maybe you could make that argument. Otherwise, it’s simply ridiculous.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: New Jersey Is Last State to Insist at Gas Station: Don’t Touch That Pump', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quote of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2018-01-06T01:05:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/5bdc4a4d-9b36-5409-8b29-28c6aa337244', 'word_count': 72, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5bdc4a4d-9b36-5409-8b29-28c6aa337244'}, {'abstract': 'The Times looks at Canadian cuisine, restaurants and chefs next week. Also, let’s hear from you on a data-driven Toronto.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/05/world/canada/google-toronto-food-canada-letter.html', 'snippet': 'The Times looks at Canadian cuisine, restaurants and chefs next week. Also, let’s hear from you on a data-driven Toronto.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Toronto has many wonderful tourist sites but its Port Lands are not among them, unless you have a keen interest in abandoned industrial buildings, gravel parking lots or concrete plants. But I wandered down there recently because of a plan put forward by a corporate relation of Google to transform the ar