1c8-e028-5351-bca9-8a5bf1d089fa'}, {'abstract': 'For decades, they warned the North was making progress on a missile that could reach the United States. But the last breakthroughs happened faster than they expected.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/06/world/asia/north-korea-nuclear-missile-intelligence.html', 'snippet': 'For decades, they warned the North was making progress on a missile that could reach the United States. But the last breakthroughs happened faster than they expected.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — At the start of Donald Trump’s presidency, American intelligence agencies told the new administration that while North Korea had built the bomb, there was still ample time — upward of four years — to slow or stop its development of a missile capable of hitting an American city with a nuclear warhead.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/us/07dc-warning1/07dc-warning1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/07/us/07dc-warning1/07dc-warning1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 392}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/us/07dc-warning1/07dc-warning1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/us/07dc-warning1/07dc-warning1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1197, 'width': 1833, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/07/us/07dc-warning1/07dc-warning1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75