419-5fcc-b295-d32a0c5c683f', 'word_count': 1378, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4384f3c3-5419-5fcc-b295-d32a0c5c683f'}, {'abstract': 'Lightly smoked salmon or tuna in single-serve bowls comes with sauce, spices and cooked rice.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/09/dining/poke-bowl-acme-smoked-fish.html', 'snippet': 'Lightly smoked salmon or tuna in single-serve bowls comes with sauce, spices and cooked rice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you cannot make it to Hawaii for poke, Acme Smoked Fish of Brooklyn has added convenient single-serving poke bowls to its product line. Lightly smoked and salt-cured diced salmon or tuna, a sauce and spices, each in separate pouches, come packed in the bowl with a serving of cooked rice that can be heated in a microwave before combining with the other ingredients. Personalize the mix with your own avocado, cucumber and herbs: Blue Hill Bay Poke Bowls, $9 to $11, at Whole Foods, Costco and Wegmans, poke.bluehillbay.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/10/dining/10burnerpoke/merlin_131843541_117952fb-7b90-4d0a-882d-501c89bc54ad-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/10/dining/10burnerpoke/merlin_131843541_117952fb-7b90-4d0a-882d-501c89bc54ad-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/10/dining/10burnerpoke/merlin_131843541_117952fb-7b90-4d0a-882d-501c89bc54ad-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/10/dining/10burnerpoke/merlin_131843541_117952fb-7b90-4d0a-882d-501c89bc54ad-superJumbo.jpg', 'hei