e/69bc47f6-854f-5f8e-bd14-8ab7a675fa68'}, {'abstract': 'In Kent, Conn. chef Joel Viehland has opened Swyft, a casual restaurant for pizza and small plates. Come summer, it will welcome a more upscale counterpart, Ore Hill.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/09/t-magazine/food/swyft-ore-hill-restaurant.html', 'snippet': 'In Kent, Conn. chef Joel Viehland has opened Swyft, a casual restaurant for pizza and small plates. Come summer, it will welcome a more upscale counterpart, Ore Hill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One frigid morning in December, a modest Revolutionary War-era wooden house in the center of Kent, Conn., was abuzz with activity. In the rear of the building, home to the newly opened restaurant Swyft, employees were tidying and prepping the night’s menu of wood-fired pizzas, fresh pastas and small plates. In a front extension, carpenters were banging away amid the elegant, putty-colored walls of Ore Hill, a fine-dining restaurant that will open early this summer.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/04/t-magazine/food/4tmag-ore-01/4tmag-ore-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/04/t-magazine/food/4tmag-ore-01/4tmag-ore-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/04/t-magazine/food/4tmag-ore-01/4tmag-ore-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/04/t-magazine/food/4tmag-ore-01/4tmag-ore-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank