red 200 million-year-old butterfly scales.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/10/science/fossils-butterflies-moths.html', 'snippet': 'While studying ancient pollen in the black goop of sediment collected in Germany, researchers discovered 200 million-year-old butterfly scales.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Any curious kids who have caught a butterfly by hand, only to find their fingers coated in messy powder, have unknowingly brushed off the fluttering insect’s scales. These microscopic plates cover almost every part of a butterfly, and are what help paint their wings a variety of colors, from shimmering cobalt blues to patterns of orange and black.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/11/science/11TB-BUTTERFLY-02/merlin_132102263_6df5d30c-a48b-4088-bb45-289bef833e45-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/11/science/11TB-BUTTERFLY-02/merlin_132102263_6df5d30c-a48b-4088-bb45-289bef833e45-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/11/science/11TB-BUTTERFLY-02/merlin_132102263_6df5d30c-a48b-4088-bb45-289bef833e45-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/11/science/11TB-BUTTERFLY-02/merlin_132102263_6df5d30c-a48b-4088-bb45-289bef833e45-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1535, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/11/science/11TB-BUTTERFLY-02/11TB-BUTTERFLY-02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 