ening Saturday for its seasonal New Beginning with new product introductions (Comme des Garçons Homme Plus Nike Air Max 180 collaborative sneakers, a Junya Watanabe Man x Carhartt WIP capsule collection), new brands (Nicholas Daley, Itchy Scratchy Patchy), new installations and updates to existing spaces. The ground floor will feature the Comme des Garçons spring collection titled “Three-Dimensional Graffiti,” which includes a multicolor polyester inkjet-printed coat ($1,940) housed in a tilted perplex structure. On the fourth floor, you’ll find a Namacheko black bird feather sweater ($1,010) among gradient-lined walls and cabinets inspired by RGB color theory, created by the men’s wear brother-and-sister team Dilan and Lezan Lurr. At 160 Lexington Avenue.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/11/fashion/11scout/11scout-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 855, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/11/fashion/11scout/11scout-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 855}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/11/fashion/11scout/11scout-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 719, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/11/fashion/11scout/11scout-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1437, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/11/fashion/11scout/11scout-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/11/fashion/11scout/11scout