rd_count': 1062, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd771ee9-cd66-51dc-91b6-d1c1448e0f76'}, {'abstract': 'The Trump administration has unveiled a Medicare program that closely resembles the Obama-era efforts to change the way doctors and hospitals are paid.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/10/us/politics/medicare-trump-administration-obamacare.html', 'snippet': 'The Trump administration has unveiled a Medicare program that closely resembles the Obama-era efforts to change the way doctors and hospitals are paid.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — In a notable back flip, the Trump administration has decided that maybe the Obama administration was right in its efforts to change the way doctors and hospitals are paid under Medicare.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/11/us/politics/11dc-health/merlin_132114302_4d7ae597-c0c2-4e43-969c-07d486ca10df-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/11/us/politics/11dc-health/merlin_132114302_4d7ae597-c0c2-4e43-969c-07d486ca10df-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/11/us/politics/11dc-health/merlin_132114302_4d7ae597-c0c2-4e43-969c-07d486ca10df-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/11/us/politics/11dc-health/merlin_132114302_4d7ae597-c0c2-4e43-969c-07d486ca10df-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1385, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/11/us/