fe doesn’t present us with many opportunities to put to use the facts that we know for no other reason than that we know them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/11/magazine/letter-of-recommendation-learned-league.html', 'snippet': 'Life doesn’t present us with many opportunities to put to use the facts that we know for no other reason than that we know them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The last time I went to trivia night at a bar, the friend who invited me set expectations unreasonably high. He announced proudly to our teammates, most of whom I’d never met, that I worked as a fact-checker for a magazine, the implication being that I was a repository of data. As it happened, my performance was subpar — until we arrived at the clincher, a double-or-nothing bonus round. “Why did a porn-production studio offer a British woman $1 million to appear in one of their films?” I bolted to attention. I had read about said British woman that very afternoon, while browsing The Daily Mail instead of attending to my fact-checking duties! “She had two vaginas,” I whispered excitedly. When we won, my friend’s friends — now, dare I say, my own — cheered with gusto.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/10/magazine/14mag-lor-top/14mag-lor-top-articleLarge.gif', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/10/magazine/14mag-lor-top/14mag-lor-top-articleLarge.gif', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/10/magazine/14mag-lor-top/14mag-lor-top-jumbo.gif', 'height': 559, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/1