oods do we owe our significant others?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/12/magazine/judge-john-hodgman-on-birthday-cakes-erotic-and-otherwise.html', 'snippet': 'What sort of baked goods do we owe our significant others?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kate writes: I have been asking my boyfriend, Brian, for a fun, fancy birthday cake for 10 years. I’ve relaxed the definition over time to include prefab cakes, like Carvel’s Cookie Puss. But he has never done it. I’m turning 40. Please order Brian to provide a custom-made fun, fancy cake.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/14/magazine/14mag-hodgman/14mag-hodgman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/14/magazine/14mag-hodgman/14mag-hodgman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 599}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/14/magazine/14mag-hodgman/14mag-hodgman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1022, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/14/magazine/14mag-hodgman/14mag-hodgman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1258, 'width': 1260, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/14/magazine/14mag-hodgman/14mag-hodgman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/14/magazine/14mag-hodgman/14mag-hodgman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'ty