/opinion/when-american-soldiers-met-vietnamese-cuisine.html', 'snippet': 'The food I encountered was a far cry from the Americanized pho and banh mi that we think of as “Vietnamese” today.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I returned to Vietnam in 2015 — my first visit since serving there with the Army in 1967 and ’68 — I was a bit nervous about how my wartime experiences would match up with today’s realities. One of my biggest worries was how I would react to the food.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/12/opinion/-13Vietnam-Morrisweb/merlin_132187997_a1948824-12cc-4977-a16d-70fd02324b94-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/12/opinion/-13Vietnam-Morrisweb/merlin_132187997_a1948824-12cc-4977-a16d-70fd02324b94-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/12/opinion/-13Vietnam-Morrisweb/merlin_132187997_a1948824-12cc-4977-a16d-70fd02324b94-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 673, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/12/opinion/-13Vietnam-Morrisweb/merlin_132187997_a1948824-12cc-4977-a16d-70fd02324b94-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1345, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/12/opinion/-13Vietnam-Morrisweb/-13Vietnam-Morrisweb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/12/opinion/-13Vietnam-Morrisweb/-13Vietnam-Morrisweb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnail