ork-horse-and-buggy-traffic-rises-and-with-it-risk.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Saturday, January 13, 2017.', 'lead_paragraph': '“You hit one of these buggies and they’re like kindling wood — they just kind of explode — and you almost always have to put the horse down.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: In Rural New York, Horse and Buggy Traffic Rises, and With It, Risk', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quote of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2018-01-13T01:12:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/e29579ca-399b-5d91-a85c-19efc7d8c02a', 'word_count': 44, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e29579ca-399b-5d91-a85c-19efc7d8c02a'}, {'abstract': 'After the agency’s workshop attracted considerable media attention, especially given President Trump’s recent words with North Korea, the session has been postponed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/12/health/cdc-nuclear-war.html', 'snippet': 'After the agency’s workshop attracted considerable media attention, especially given President Trump’s recent words with North Korea, the session has been postponed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Centers for Disease Control and Prevention has decided to postpone  its session on nuclear attack preparedness next week. Much attention had been drawn to the timing of the agency’s session, which was publicized just days after President Trump touted the size of his nuclear button compared with North Korea’s.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/13/science/13CDC/13CDC-articleLarge.jpg', 'he