arning Systems', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disasters and Emergencies', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Communications Commission', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Emergency Management Agency', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hawaii Emergency Management Agency', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-01-14T01:33:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cecilia Kang', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cecilia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kang', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/621c744f-b3fc-5fdf-9b09-156910abc25a', 'word_count': 936, 'uri': 'nyt://article/621c744f-b3fc-5fdf-9b09-156910abc25a'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Sunday, January 14, 2018.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/13/todayspaper/quotation-of-the-day-trumps-jabs-echo-attitudes-from-the-20s.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Sunday, January 14, 2018.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Obviously he likes Norwegians because they are white. But he knows nothing about Norway, a country with single-payer universal health care and free college education. Why would anyone want to leave Norway for the U.S.?”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: Trump’s Jabs Echo Attitudes From the ’20s', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quote of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2018-01-14T02:56:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://artic