le/watches-women-auction-artcurial.html', 'snippet': 'Over the years many had discussed such a themed sale, an expert for the auction house Artcurial said, but no one ever made it happen until now.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An auction of vintage watches is scheduled for Jan. 18 in the ballroom of the Monaco Yacht Club, an event that ordinarily would not be considered unusual. But this particular sale is set to make a small mark on horological history as the first dedicated to watches made for women, according to its organizer, the French auction house Artcurial.', 'print_section': 'S', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/15/style/15artcurial-inyt1/16artcurial-inyt1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/15/style/15artcurial-inyt1/16artcurial-inyt1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/15/style/15artcurial-inyt1/16artcurial-inyt1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/15/style/15artcurial-inyt1/16artcurial-inyt1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/15/style/15artcurial-inyt1/16artcurial-inyt1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/15/style/15artcurial-inyt1/16artcurial-inyt1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thu