and equality in America. “Happy birthday,” Stevie Wonder first sang in 1980. “Sing it loud as you can.” If you’d like to bake in celebration, try Melissa Clark’s recipe for an almond birthday cake with sherry-lemon buttercream (above), though history records Dr. King’s preferred dessert as  pecan pie.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/dining/video-clark-cake-buttercream/video-clark-cake-buttercream-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/06/dining/video-clark-cake-buttercream/video-clark-cake-buttercream-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/dining/video-clark-cake-buttercream/video-clark-cake-buttercream-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 432, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/dining/video-clark-cake-buttercream/video-clark-cake-buttercream-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 432, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/dining/video-clark-cake-buttercream/video-clark-cake-buttercream-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/06/dining/video-clark-cake-buttercream/video-clark-cake-buttercream-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/dining/video-clark-cake-buttercream/video-clark-cake-buttercream-thumbLarge