otential is only beginning to be explored.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/16/dining/drinks/wine-ontario-pearl-morissette.html', 'snippet': 'Though better known for ice wines, the regions near Lake Ontario produce gorgeous dry wines, and their potential is only beginning to be explored.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JORDAN, Ontario — Though his wines are found in many natural wine bars around the world, please do not call François Morissette a natural winemaker. And though Pearl Morissette, his estate near this small town on the Niagara Peninsula, produces wines that are luminous and inspiring, it’s better not to call him a winemaker at all.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/17/dining/17pour3/merlin_132138539_9c69557b-740d-4f8d-90a9-734f7a2bda5c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/17/dining/17pour3/merlin_132138539_9c69557b-740d-4f8d-90a9-734f7a2bda5c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/17/dining/17pour3/merlin_132138539_9c69557b-740d-4f8d-90a9-734f7a2bda5c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/17/dining/17pour3/merlin_132138539_9c69557b-740d-4f8d-90a9-734f7a2bda5c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/17/dining/17pour3/merlin_132138539_9c69557b-740d-4f8d-90a9-734f7a2bda5c-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTyp