s and disdain for democratic protections, President Rodrigo Duterte of the Philippines stands out for his viciousness. He has effectively declared open season on those he and his minions accuse of being drug users and dealers, at least 4,000 of whom have been killed by the police and vigilantes since he came to office.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/17/opinion/17wed2web/merlin_132346211_a88d5b11-65c9-4182-81f5-b2cf987a4fd6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/17/opinion/17wed2web/merlin_132346211_a88d5b11-65c9-4182-81f5-b2cf987a4fd6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/17/opinion/17wed2web/merlin_132346211_a88d5b11-65c9-4182-81f5-b2cf987a4fd6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/17/opinion/17wed2web/merlin_132346211_a88d5b11-65c9-4182-81f5-b2cf987a4fd6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1293, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/17/opinion/17wed2web/17wed2web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/17/opinion/17wed2web/17wed2web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/17/opinion/17wed2web/17wed2web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'wid