: '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/67b0febe-910a-57b2-8dd6-dfbd06e01aa5', 'word_count': 1471, 'uri': 'nyt://article/67b0febe-910a-57b2-8dd6-dfbd06e01aa5'}, {'abstract': 'When the woman experienced dark moods out of the blue, psychiatrists treated her. But the medications didn’t help.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/18/magazine/it-looked-like-a-familiar-case-of-depression-but-could-it-be-something-else.html', 'snippet': 'When the woman experienced dark moods out of the blue, psychiatrists treated her. But the medications didn’t help.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Have you been to see your doctor?” the woman asked her 72-year-old mother anxiously. Her mother had come from Miami to visit her in New York. They hadn’t seen each other for a couple of months, and her daughter hardly recognized her. Her mother had been slender; now, she looked emaciated. Her usually bright eyes peered dully above her newly prominent cheekbones.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/21/magazine/21mag-diagnosis1/21mag-21diagnosis-t_CA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 524, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/21/magazine/21mag-diagnosis1/21mag-21diagnosis-t_CA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 524}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/21/magazine/21mag-diagnosis1/21mag-21diagnosis-t_CA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 894, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/21/magazine/21mag-diagnosis1/21mag-21diagnosis-t_CA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1500, 'width': 1719, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_na