om/2018/01/18/dining/old-forester-cocktail-provisions.html', 'snippet': 'Old Forester Cocktail Provisions includes bitters, syrups and a tincture for a better old-fashioned.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Old Forester, the bourbon brand, has introduced a collection of cocktail components meant for the perfect old-fashioned. Jackie Zykan, the company’s master taster, helped create the three kinds of bitters ($11.50 each), in cherry-tobacco, cinnamon-black tea and citrus flavors; two syrups ($8.50 each), Demerara and citrus; and a tincture of smoked sea salt and black pepper ($7.50). All are suited for an old-fashioned or other cocktails. They’re made by Bourbon Barrel Foods, a Louisville company known for its condiments: Old Forester Cocktail Provisions, store.oldforester.com and bourbonbarrelfoods.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/24/dining/24burnerkit/merlin_132149493_27a55b3b-c59b-4176-b3f1-f7d6b734f230-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 371, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/24/dining/24burnerkit/merlin_132149493_27a55b3b-c59b-4176-b3f1-f7d6b734f230-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 371}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/24/dining/24burnerkit/merlin_132149493_27a55b3b-c59b-4176-b3f1-f7d6b734f230-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 634, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/24/dining/24burnerkit/merlin_132149493_27a55b3b-c59b-4176-b3f1-f7d6b734f230-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1268, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '