alpaso’s dancers remain driven and invigorating, but the dances on its program at the Joyce felt like missteps.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/18/arts/dance/malpaso-dance-company-joyce-review.html', 'snippet': 'Malpaso’s dancers remain driven and invigorating, but the dances on its program at the Joyce felt like missteps.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was a bold move when Osnel Delgado and Daileidys Carrazana left Danza Contemporánea de Cuba to form their own company, with Fernando Sáez, in 2012. And it was even cheekier when they named their troupe after the Spanish word for “misstep.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/arts/19Malpaso-1/19Malpaso-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/19/arts/19Malpaso-1/19Malpaso-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/arts/19Malpaso-1/19Malpaso-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/arts/19Malpaso-1/19Malpaso-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/arts/19Malpaso-1/19Malpaso-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/19/arts/19Malpaso-1/19Malpaso-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': N