ern France.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/18/obituaries/peter-mayle-who-wrote-of-a-year-in-provence-is-dead-at-78.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Mayle, an Englishman, spawned a genre in 1989 with his travel memoir about renovating a house in Southern France.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Peter Mayle, an Englishman who started a writing career in his 30s with sex-education books for children before making a spectacularly successful switch to the travel memoir genre with “A Year in Provence,” his 1989 best seller about relocating to Southern France, died on Thursday at a hospital near his home there. He was 78.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/obituaries/mayle-obit-1/mayle-obit-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 941, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/19/obituaries/mayle-obit-1/mayle-obit-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 941}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/obituaries/mayle-obit-1/mayle-obit-1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 974, 'width': 621, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/obituaries/mayle-obit-1/mayle-obit-1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 974, 'width': 621, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/obituaries/mayle-obit-1/mayle-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/19/obituaries/mayle-obit-1/mayle-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 7