rd through eighth graders around New York State.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/18/nyregion/breach-at-questar-allows-access-to-52-students-data.html', 'snippet': 'An unauthorized user viewed names, grade levels, identification numbers and teacher names for third through eighth graders around New York State.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A data breach at the company that develops New York State’s third-through-eighth grade reading and math tests allowed an unauthorized user to access information about 52 students who took the tests by computer last spring, the state’s Education Department said on Thursday. The data that was viewed included students’ names, New York State Student Identification numbers, school names, grade levels and teacher names.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Breach at Testing Company Allows Access to 52 Students’ Data', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Breach at Testing Company  Allows Unauthorized User  Access to Students’ Data', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Questar Assessment Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reading and Writing Skills (Education)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer Security', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Education Department (NYS)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Elia, MaryEllen (1948- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schneiderman, Eric T', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-01-19T00:54:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlen