//article/adcfd354-91e6-5045-8c20-3ddd5df7049d'}, {'abstract': 'Federal and local governments are not doing their jobs, so nonprofit organizations are working to fill the void.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/19/opinion/the-shadow-safety-net.html', 'snippet': 'Federal and local governments are not doing their jobs, so nonprofit organizations are working to fill the void.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As we make our way through the coldest days of winter, it’s hard not to notice people without homes, freezing on street corners or sleeping in subway cars. The problems are clear: There are many homeless people in big cities like New York and Los Angeles, and there is still not a constitutional right to housing, no guarantee even of a bed in a shelter.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/opinion/19Quartweb/merlin_131976971_ecc8c4f8-75ea-4458-9157-acba0c61867b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/19/opinion/19Quartweb/merlin_131976971_ecc8c4f8-75ea-4458-9157-acba0c61867b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/opinion/19Quartweb/merlin_131976971_ecc8c4f8-75ea-4458-9157-acba0c61867b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/opinion/19Quartweb/merlin_131976971_ecc8c4f8-75ea-4458-9157-acba0c61867b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/opinion/19Quartweb/19Quartweb-thumbStan