he branch in a damp cloth and hid it in her black coat. “If the ficus takes root here then I’ll take root too,” she said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/19/well/family/the-ficus-that-crossed-an-ocean.html', 'snippet': 'My grandmother wrapped the branch in a damp cloth and hid it in her black coat. “If the ficus takes root here then I’ll take root too,” she said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1987 my grandmother, Sima, left her home in Bucharest, Romania, to move in with me, my sister and my parents in northern New Jersey. The move was a leap of many kinds of faith. After 40 years in the same apartment, she closed her door and crossed an ocean. She was 78, spoke no English and had no friends here. In Romania’s capital she walked almost daily to the grocer, or the theater or a friend’s place. When she stayed home she watched life on the streets below from her window.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/well/family/well-family-ficus/well-family-ficus-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 502, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/19/well/family/well-family-ficus/well-family-ficus-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 502}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/well/family/well-family-ficus/well-family-ficus-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 856, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/well/family/well-family-ficus/well-family-ficus-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1712, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/19/well/family/well