y or push you to be a better version of yourself?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/19/realestate/surviving-a-bad-airbnb-review.html', 'snippet': 'Posting a bad review is one thing, but what if a host calls you a bad guest? Would that make you crazy or push you to be a better version of yourself?', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the most part, my home is clean. Dishes get done, counters get wiped. I even keep a cordless vacuum cleaner handy to do battle with the dust bunnies. So, imagine my surprise when I received a bad Airbnb review from the owners of a charming cottage in Cape Cod where my family and I spent a two-week vacation last summer.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/21/realestate/21RIGHTATHOME/21RIGHTATHOME-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 266, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/21/realestate/21RIGHTATHOME/21RIGHTATHOME-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 266}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/21/realestate/21RIGHTATHOME/21RIGHTATHOME-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 454, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/21/realestate/21RIGHTATHOME/21RIGHTATHOME-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 908, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/21/realestate/21RIGHTATHOME/21RIGHTATHOME-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/21/realestate/21RIGHTATHOME/21RIGHTATHOME-thumbStandard.jpg', 