7a0c971'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Simmons talks about his work in Starz’s “Counterpart” and life since winning an Oscar.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/19/arts/television/jk-simmons-counterpart.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Simmons talks about his work in Starz’s “Counterpart” and life since winning an Oscar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What if you suddenly discovered that you had a badass doppelgänger, one with the power you’d been lacking all your life? That’s the central premise of “Counterpart,” the new espionage-meets-sci-fi series in which J.K. Simmons does double duty as two leading men. He plays Howard Silk, a mild-mannered office drone for a United Nations-like organization, his job so arcane even he isn’t sure what he does.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/21/arts/21SNAPSHOT/21SNAPSHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1090, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/21/arts/21SNAPSHOT/21SNAPSHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1090}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/21/arts/21SNAPSHOT/21SNAPSHOT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 564, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/21/arts/21SNAPSHOT/21SNAPSHOT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1128, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/21/arts/21SNAPSHOT/21SNAPSHOT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/21/arts/21SNAPSHOT/21SNAPSHOT-thumb