ner.html', 'snippet': 'Where do our persistent sexual fantasies come from? And is it possible to escape their grip? In part two of our Dark Fantasies series, the Sugars try to answer these questions.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I’m a 24-year-old woman who is completely and embarrassingly aroused by people who are confined to wheelchairs,” writes a woman who calls herself “Wishing to be Seen.” In her pained letter, she explains the possible origins of her isolating fetish and asks the Sugars for a way out: “I just want to have an orgasm with a real human rather than with my sad self, in my sad bed, sadly watching YouTube videos of women I feel I am objectifying and using.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'height': 451, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 451}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-jumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 957, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-superJumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 957, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-article-art-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/08/22/insider/SUGARS-article-art/SUGARS-