ands of Dr. Lawrence G. Nassar, top officials for the federation’s board announced they would step down.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/22/sports/olympics/several-usa-gymnastics-board-members-resign.html', 'snippet': 'As more victims read statements about abuse at the hands of Dr. Lawrence G. Nassar, top officials for the federation’s board announced they would step down.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The organization that governs gymnastics in the United States said its chairman and several board members had resigned under intense pressure resulting from the molestation case involving a team doctor. The announcement was made Monday, as dozens more young women and girls gave victim-impact statements in a Michigan courtroom.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/23/sports/gymnastics-board-web/gymnastics-board-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/23/sports/gymnastics-board-web/gymnastics-board-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/23/sports/gymnastics-board-web/gymnastics-board-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/23/sports/gymnastics-board-web/gymnastics-board-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/23/sports/gymnastics-board-web/gymnastics-board-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy':