 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/a4811e00-3fb1-562a-a0c7-0f1b0b31284f', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/a4811e00-3fb1-562a-a0c7-0f1b0b31284f'}, {'abstract': 'Sometimes coming home is the hardest move of all.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/22/opinion/baby-brother.html', 'snippet': 'Sometimes coming home is the hardest move of all.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This film was born out of another film that fell through because I couldn’t fund it. When you have a camera but no money, you make do with what you can. Often, that means looking around for what’s closest to you. Call it “proximity cinema,” a type of cinema for the poor. This film, about my younger brother’s experiences moving back to our family’s home in Missouri, is a good example.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Baby Brother', 'kicker': 'Op-Docs', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-01-22T20:55:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kamau Bilal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kamau', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bilal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/36046e27-1407-532b-85fa-a9f2d43796c4', 'word_count': 361, 'uri': 'nyt://article/36046e27-1407-532b-85fa-a9f2d43796c4'}, {'abstract': 'The spring 2018 couture collection', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2018/01/22/fashion/runway-couture/giambattista-valli-spring-2018.html', 'snippet': 'The spring 2018 couture collection', 'lead_paragraph': 'The spring 2018 couture collection', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'ra