ddlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c5e7d382-79c4-5d2c-a15a-e85bc0fd6efd', 'word_count': 1157, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c5e7d382-79c4-5d2c-a15a-e85bc0fd6efd'}, {'abstract': 'Although Democrats will probably pick up a few additional seats in this year’s election, the development is less helpful for them than it might at first appear.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/22/upshot/pennsylvania-congressional-map-ruling.html', 'snippet': 'Although Democrats will probably pick up a few additional seats in this year’s election, the development is less helpful for them than it might at first appear.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Republicans are counting on a favorable congressional map to help their majority ride out a possible “wave” election this November. But the congressional map got a little less favorable on Monday when the Pennsylvania Supreme Court struck down the state’s Republican-drawn congressional map.  ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/22/upshot/up-pa-verdict-1516652701838/up-pa-verdict-1516652701838-articleLarge-v2.png', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/22/upshot/up-pa-verdict-1516652701838/up-pa-verdict-1516652701838-articleLarge-v2.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/22/upshot/up-pa-verdict-1516652701838/up-pa-verdict-1516652701838-jumbo-v2.png', 'height': 563, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/22/upshot/up-pa-verdict-1516652701838/up-pa-v