the president a would-be despot or a force of chaos? Ross Douthat and David Frum debate the question.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/23/opinion/david-frum-trumpcocracy.html', 'snippet': 'Is the president a would-be despot or a force of chaos? Ross Douthat and David Frum debate the question.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Has America become a “Trumpocracy,” and is what we’re watching a tragedy or a farce? Ross Douthat, a Times Op-Ed columnist, and David Frum, a senior editor at The Atlantic and the author of “Trumpocracy: The Corruption of the American Republic,” debated these questions in an online discussion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/23/opinion/23douthatWeb/23douthatWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 531, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/23/opinion/23douthatWeb/23douthatWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 531}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/23/opinion/23douthatWeb/23douthatWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 906, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/23/opinion/23douthatWeb/23douthatWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1812, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/23/opinion/23douthatWeb/23douthatWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/23/opinion/23douthatWeb/23douthatWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cr