}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/baec4a4c-01ee-54d6-9cea-c47bcee4efeb', 'word_count': 510, 'uri': 'nyt://article/baec4a4c-01ee-54d6-9cea-c47bcee4efeb'}, {'abstract': 'A practitioner known to slim physiques with her “magic” hands arrives in New York — along with a few new sculpting products to try at home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/23/t-magazine/body-contouring.html', 'snippet': 'A practitioner known to slim physiques with her “magic” hands arrives in New York — along with a few new sculpting products to try at home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Clémence von Mueffling, the Paris-born editor of Beauty and Well Being, remembers the first time she heard about Martine de Richeville. “I was told she had ‘magic’ hands and could help with cellulite and heavy legs,” von Mueffling says of the French therapist with a discreet fashion-crowd following. “At the time, her name was like a secret that only a very good friend would give you.” De Richeville specializes in rémodelage, a technique that involves pinching and kneading to break up fat deposits and flush toxins through lymphatic drainage. (“It definitely feels a little painful,” von Mueffling concedes.) With regular sessions, devotees notice a slimmer, tighter silhouette. Or as von Mueffling explains, “it’s as if she puts your body in ‘restart’ mode.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/24/t-magazine/24tmag-bodycountouring01/24tmag-bodycountouring01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/24/t-magazine/24tmag-bodycountouring01/24tmag-bodycountouring01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/24/t-magazine/24tmag-bodycountouring01/24tmag-bodycountouring01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/24/t-magazine/24tmag-bodycountouring01/24tmag-bodycountouring01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/24/t-magazine/24tmag-bodycountouring01/24tmag-bodycountouring01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/24/t-magazine/24tmag-bodycountouring01/24tmag-bodycountouring01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/24/t-magazine/24tmag-bodycountouring01/24tmag-bodycountouring01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Beloved French Practice of Body-Contouring Spreads Stateside', 'kicker': 'On Beauty', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'von Mueffling, Clemence', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beauty (Concept)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-01-23T21:56:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kari Molvar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kari', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Molvar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1d44571b-7126-55c5-ac4a-3b211de82680', 'word_count': 558, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1d44571b-7126-55c5-ac4a-3b211de82680'}, {'abstract': 'Richard Trumka, the president of the A.F.L.-C.I.O., delivered a searing critique of the president’s first year, saying his policies favored corporations over workers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/23/us/politics/trump-trumka-unions-afl-cio.html', 'snippet': 'Richard Trumka, the president of the A.F.L.-C.I.O., delivered a searing critique of the president’s first year, saying his policies favored corporations over workers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The president of the A.F.L.-C.I.O., Richard Trumka, who flirted with an alliance with President Trump, delivered a searing critique on Tuesday of the president’s first year, saying that he had used the White House “to actively hurt working people” and favor corporate interests.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/24/us/politics/24dc-trumka/merlin_132775688_d83a8c3f-97c2-431b-8bb0-1dafa66c0237-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/24/us/politics/24dc-trumka/merlin_132775688_d83a8c3f-97c2-431b-8bb0-1dafa66c0237-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/24/us/politics/24dc-trumka/merlin_132775688_d83a8c3f-97c2-431b-8bb0-1dafa66c0237-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/24/us/politics/24dc-trumka/merlin_132775688_d83a8c3f-97c2-431b-8bb0-1dafa66c0237-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', '