U.S.A. Gymnastics and Michigan State team doctor, was sentenced to 40 to 175 years in prison for sexual abuse.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/24/sports/larry-nassar-sentencing.html', 'snippet': 'Dr. Nassar, the former U.S.A. Gymnastics and Michigan State team doctor, was sentenced to 40 to 175 years in prison for sexual abuse.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LANSING, Mich. — The former doctor for the American gymnastics team, Dr. Lawrence G. Nassar, was sentenced to 40 to 175 years in prison on Wednesday for multiple sex crimes, capping an extraordinary seven-day hearing that drew more than 150 young women to publicly confront him and speak of their abuse.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Larry Nassar Sentencing: ‘I Just Signed Your Death Warrant’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gymnasts’ Abuse Draws Sentence  Likely to Be Life', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gymnastics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nassar, Lawrence G (1963- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Aquilina, Rosemarie', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-01-24T17:39:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Cacciola and Victor Mather', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cacciola', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Victor', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mather', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'report