i': 'nyt://article/8b4ef766-91f3-5a47-af6a-9439945893ee'}, {'abstract': 'The Justice Department rebuked an effort by House Republicans to undermine the Russia investigation by pushing to release a memo said to accuse the F.B.I. of abusing its power.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/24/us/politics/devin-nunes-fbi-russia.html', 'snippet': 'The Justice Department rebuked an effort by House Republicans to undermine the Russia investigation by pushing to release a memo said to accuse the F.B.I. of abusing its power.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Justice Department warned the House Intelligence Committee chairman on Wednesday that it was “extraordinarily reckless” for Republicans to push to release a committee memo that draws on classified information to portray the origins of the Russian investigation as scandalous.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/25/us/politics/25dc-memo1/merlin_132369341_37d7c50c-efaa-4c8b-870f-59ab01f14c76-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/25/us/politics/25dc-memo1/merlin_132369341_37d7c50c-efaa-4c8b-870f-59ab01f14c76-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 420}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/25/us/politics/25dc-memo1/merlin_132369341_37d7c50c-efaa-4c8b-870f-59ab01f14c76-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/25/us/politics/25dc-memo1/merlin_132369341_37d7c50c-efaa-4c8b-870f-59ab01f14c76-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1435, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, '