html', 'snippet': 'There are two issues at stake in the Russia investigation: our nation’s sovereignty and our nation’s soul.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The past few days have seen a flurry of news about the Robert Mueller investigation: who has been interviewed (Attorney General Jeff Sessions), whom Mueller plans to interview shortly (Donald Trump) and the seeming focus of Mueller’s inquiry (obstruction of justice).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/24/opinion/25Blow-web/merlin_132778542_34b27106-49d9-44d1-82fc-aca5c6080ab7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/24/opinion/25Blow-web/merlin_132778542_34b27106-49d9-44d1-82fc-aca5c6080ab7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/24/opinion/25Blow-web/merlin_132778542_34b27106-49d9-44d1-82fc-aca5c6080ab7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/24/opinion/25Blow-web/merlin_132778542_34b27106-49d9-44d1-82fc-aca5c6080ab7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/24/opinion/25Blow-web/merlin_132778542_34b27106-49d9-44d1-82fc-aca5c6080ab7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/24/opinion/25Blow-web/merlin_132778542_34b27106-49d9-44d1-82fc-aca5c6080ab7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLa