father and a good boyfriend.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/26/nyregion/how-roy-wood-jr-comedian-spends-his-sundays.html', 'snippet': 'This is the one day of the week where Mr. Wood says he can be a triple threat: a good comic, a good father and a good boyfriend.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The comedian and actor Roy Wood Jr. still likes to drive; it gives him time to think, and it reminds him of his days honing his craft as a road comic. These days, Mr. Wood, 39, is a correspondent on “The Daily Show With Trevor Noah,” and starting Feb. 2, he will be the host of the new season of “This Is Not Happening” on Comedy Central. So while his weekends are for unwinding — spending quality time in Hell’s Kitchen, where Mr. Wood lives with Salone Monet, his girlfriend, and their toddler son — early Sunday mornings often begin in a rental car, with him racing home from another state after a night of telling jokes to a room full of strangers.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/28/nyregion/28routine1/merlin_132472854_16587f58-079b-495d-94e0-ad2c25570800-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/28/nyregion/28routine1/merlin_132472854_16587f58-079b-495d-94e0-ad2c25570800-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/28/nyregion/28routine1/merlin_132472854_16587f58-079b-495d-94e0-ad2c25570800-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/28/nyregion/28routine1/merlin_132472854_16587f58-079b-495d-94e0-ad2c25570800-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365