inoff of “RuPaul’s Drag Race,” pits runners-up and fan favorites from past seasons against each other for a second chance at glory — glory being $100,000 and a spot in the “Drag Race” Hall of Fame, parodied in a clever cold open with the two previous winners Chad Michaels and Alaska (renamed “Ofrupaul”) strolling in “Handmaid’s Tale” garb. “The ‘Drag Race’ Hall of Fame really isn’t what I thought it was going to be,” Alaska said. “You look really nice in red, though.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/27/arts/television/27rupaul/27rupaul-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/27/arts/television/27rupaul/27rupaul-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/27/arts/television/27rupaul/27rupaul-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/27/arts/television/27rupaul/27rupaul-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/27/arts/television/27rupaul/27rupaul-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/27/arts/television/27rupaul/27rupaul-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/27/arts/television/27rupaul/27rupaul-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'th