ract': 'A roundup of things T editors — and a few contributors — are excited about in a given week. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/26/t-magazine/seven-things-t-editors-like-right-now.html', 'snippet': 'A roundup of things T editors — and a few contributors — are excited about in a given week. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last week, New York City’s \u200bNoMad Hotel went west, opening a 241-room outpost in downtown Los Angeles. For the interiors of the 1920s neo-Classical building, formerly known as Giannini Place, the Sydell Group again tapped the French architect Jacques Garcia, who looked to his own light-filled \u200bvilla in Sicily. \u200bIn the lobby, beneath a 20-foot restored coffered ceiling, potted palm trees and birds of paradise sit alongside jade green velvet drapes by Nina Campbell and floral couches by Matthew Williamson. There’s also an espresso bar modeled after Venice’s Caffè Florian. At night, it switches from coffee to cocktails — try the Martini, made with cocoa-nib infused cognac, Kahlúa, cold brew and crème de cacao.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/26/t-magazine/26tmag-tel-slide-OI20/26tmag-tel-slide-OI20-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/26/t-magazine/26tmag-tel-slide-OI20/26tmag-tel-slide-OI20-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/26/t-magazine/26tmag-tel-slide-OI20/26tmag-tel-slide-OI20-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/26/t-magazine/26tmag-tel-slide-OI20/26tmag-tel-slide-OI20-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/26/t-magazine/26tmag-tel-slide-OI20/26tmag-tel-slide-OI20-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/26/t-magazine/26tmag-tel-slide-OI20/26tmag-tel-slide-OI20-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/26/t-magazine/26tmag-tel-slide-OI20/26tmag-tel-slide-OI20-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Seven Things T Editors Like Right Now', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shoes and Boots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Feit', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beauty (Concept)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-01-26T22:18:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/94b5d989-ac5e-5e52-bcfa-0d48bfe38889', 'word_count': 1407, 'uri': 'nyt://article/94b5d989-ac5e-5e52-bcfa-0d48bfe38889'}, {'abstract': 'President Trump gave an uncharacteristically restrained speech in Davos on Friday. But the world’s political and business leaders remain wary of him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/26/opinion/davos-trump-world-economic-forum.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump gave an uncharacteristically restrained speech in Davos on Friday. But the world’s political and business leaders remain wary of him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the global governing elite gathered in Davos, Switzerland, for the annual World Economic Forum this week, a classic horror movie came to my mind. Perhaps you remember the scene from “When a Stranger Calls” where a panicked babysitter, stalked by phone, gets on the line with a police officer. The quiet terror of the officer’s words: “We’ve traced the call. It’s coming from inside the house.” Then: “Just get out!”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/26/opinion/26blinkenWeb/merlin_132916277_318141df-ca4d-45df-811d-3d9c8420e52c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/26/opinion/26blinkenWeb/merlin_132916277_318141df-ca4d-45df-811d-3d9c8420e52c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/26/opinion/26blinkenWeb/merlin_132916277_318141df-ca4d-45df-811d-3d9c8420e52c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/26/opinion/26blinkenWeb/merlin_132916277_318141df-ca4d-45df-811d-3d9c8420e52c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/26/opinion/26blinkenWeb/26blinkenWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 7