id Friday that it would comply with the demands of the United States Olympic Committee, which called for the entire board to step down.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/26/sports/usa-gymnastics-board-nassar.html', 'snippet': 'The organization said Friday that it would comply with the demands of the United States Olympic Committee, which called for the entire board to step down.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bowing to the demands of the United States Olympic Committee, U.S.A. Gymnastics confirmed Friday night that all the remaining members of its board of directors would resign — the latest fallout from a widespread sexual abuse scandal involving the federation’s longtime national team doctor, Lawrence G. Nassar.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/27/autossell/27xp-Gynnastics/merlin_132361679_a4628c7a-897e-490c-aff8-b7cacce04c07-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/27/autossell/27xp-Gynnastics/merlin_132361679_a4628c7a-897e-490c-aff8-b7cacce04c07-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/27/autossell/27xp-Gynnastics/merlin_132361679_a4628c7a-897e-490c-aff8-b7cacce04c07-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/27/autossell/27xp-Gynnastics/merlin_132361679_a4628c7a-897e-490c-aff8-b7cacce04c07-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/27/autosse