}, {'abstract': 'The women, who were contemporaries at the Naval Academy, are part of a powerful wave of political activism in the era of President Trump.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/29/us/politics/women-annapolis-democrats-congress-trump.html', 'snippet': 'The women, who were contemporaries at the Naval Academy, are part of a powerful wave of political activism in the era of President Trump.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NORFOLK, Va. — Elaine Luria commanded an assault ship with a crew of 400 that patrolled the Persian Gulf for hostile Iranian vessels. Amy McGrath was the first female Marine to fly in an F-18 fighter jet in combat, dropping bombs over Afghanistan and Iraq. Mikie Sherrill was certified as a Navy helicopter pilot only after passing an underwater crash simulation in which she was blindfolded, turned upside down, and forced to find the sole exit door.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/29/us/29dc-candidates4/29dc-candidates4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 256, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/29/us/29dc-candidates4/29dc-candidates4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 256}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/29/us/29dc-candidates4/29dc-candidates4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 866, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/29/us/29dc-candidates4/29dc-candidates4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 866, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/29/us/29dc-candidates4/29