 'For the first time, a Major Food Group menu doesn’t quite measure up to its restaurant’s busy spectacle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/30/dining/the-lobster-club-review.html', 'snippet': 'For the first time, a Major Food Group menu doesn’t quite measure up to its restaurant’s busy spectacle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One thing that sets Rich Torrisi and Mario Carbone apart from other very talented chefs is how happy they seem to be creating restaurants that are not about them, or even primarily about cooking. While their peers were putting their kitchen skill front and center, through tasting menus or through restaurants where decoration was minimal and amenities were pared back until there was almost nothing left but the plates, they went in the opposite direction.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/31/dining/31REST-slide-NJ9E/31REST-slide-NJ9E-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/31/dining/31REST-slide-NJ9E/31REST-slide-NJ9E-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/31/dining/31REST-slide-NJ9E/31REST-slide-NJ9E-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/31/dining/31REST-slide-NJ9E/31REST-slide-NJ9E-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/31/dining/31REST-slide-NJ9E/31REST-slide-NJ9E-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 's