: 'nyt://article/38344d33-f8c5-51f7-a24f-397cfd8359fa'}, {'abstract': 'Todd Ricketts is expected to be the new finance chairman for the Republican National Committee, replacing the disgraced casino magnate Steve Wynn.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/30/us/politics/chicago-cubs-todd-ricketts-rnc-finance-chairman.html', 'snippet': 'Todd Ricketts is expected to be the new finance chairman for the Republican National Committee, replacing the disgraced casino magnate Steve Wynn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Todd Ricketts, a co-owner of the Chicago Cubs, is expected to be named the new finance chairman of the Republican National Committee, replacing the casino magnate Steve Wynn, who was pushed out amid allegations of serious sexual abuse, three Republican officials said on Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/30/us/31dc-RNC/31dc-RNC-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/30/us/31dc-RNC/31dc-RNC-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/30/us/31dc-RNC/31dc-RNC-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/30/us/31dc-RNC/31dc-RNC-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1352, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/30/us/31dc-RNC/31dc-RNC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/