n law to bring violence to the United States, and he would close them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/31/nyregion/ms-13-gang-trump.html', 'snippet': 'The president said the “savage gang” had taken advantage of loopholes in immigration law to bring violence to the United States, and he would close them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In his State of the Union speech on Tuesday night President Trump said that illegal immigrants “have caused the loss of many innocent lives,” and he paid special attention to the gang known as MS-13. Many of its members, he said, “took advantage of glaring loopholes in our laws to enter the country as unaccompanied alien minors” and then ended up murdering American citizens.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/07/16/nyregion/01ms13-speech/01ms13-speech-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/07/16/nyregion/01ms13-speech/01ms13-speech-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/07/16/nyregion/01ms13-speech/01ms13-speech-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/07/16/nyregion/01ms13-speech/01ms13-speech-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/07/16/nyregion/01ms13-speech/01ms13-speech-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/07/16/nyregion/01ms13-speech/01ms13-spe