a1513569-bd46-5443-88f2-ee2791b3232c'}, {'abstract': 'For two decades, university officials dismissed or silenced Larry Nassar’s victims. Now its trustees should resign to make way for new leadership.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/31/opinion/editorials/larry-nassar-michigan-state.html', 'snippet': 'For two decades, university officials dismissed or silenced Larry Nassar’s victims. Now its trustees should resign to make way for new leadership.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Larry Nassar had a day of reckoning last week for his years of molesting young gymnasts and other athletes, and he will spend the rest of his life in prison. But the leaders of Michigan State University, where he worked, have yet to take full responsibility for their failures to protect those girls, or to even learn what went wrong and regain the trust of the public.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/31/opinion/01Thu2/merlin_132936020_d8d9e00a-b2fb-4eba-b5ad-1d689996e63b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/31/opinion/01Thu2/merlin_132936020_d8d9e00a-b2fb-4eba-b5ad-1d689996e63b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/31/opinion/01Thu2/merlin_132936020_d8d9e00a-b2fb-4eba-b5ad-1d689996e63b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/31/opinion/01Thu2/merlin_132936020_d8d9e00a-b2fb-4eba-b5ad-1d689996e63b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1335, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail',